Max change log (2000)
=====================

VERSION HISTORY
---------------

Major customer releases:
	April 2000:  max3.2.14  
	Dec   2000:  max4.0.2

12/19/00 4.0.2
	Initial Max 4 release (to customers!)
	(updated to 4.0.3 on 1/10/01)

11/6/00	Max 3.5.11

	(since Max3.5.10)

	gds read of gcells implemented.

	fixed selection flakiness 
	(by implementing sel_buffer and using in selection_restore)

	fixed db_cell_copy coredump (flyline problem.) 

	command line processing changed to handle 'foo.':  now loads 'foo.max'.
	(C and tcl changes.)

	added gds_plot_key command.   Will be used to allow gdsplot to be invoked 
	from Max without requiring a separate gdsplot license)

10/3/00	Max 3.5.7
	support for more layers (100+ layers)
	(including palette scroll bar!)
	
	'true' color support (aka 24 bit-color)  
	('max -visual true' for 8 bit true color on your desk top SPARC)

	.max write performance bug fixed 
	(Was slow when writing many small files.)

	flyline redisplay bug fixed.

	gds write flatten gcells option fixed to work for groups.

8/16/00	Max 3.2.17
	extractor fixes.
	security fixes (secure Tcl_Eval) and strip comments on MCC

6/9/00  Max 3.3.1
	saving gcells to parent .max files (new .max format)
	implemented non-bit mapped highlighting.

7/10/00 Max 3.2.16
	fixed bug in mc (mc2.0.4)	

3/21/00 Max 3.2.14 (BASED ON 3.2.11, official release?)
	Does not include changes of 3.2.12 and 3.2.13,
	Identical to 3.2.11, except:
	
	License problem fixed.
	mcc tutorial added.		

3/15/00 Max 3.2.13 BETA 
	files homed to  directory of gds file being read.
	modified 'db_search cells -any_cell' to include expanded instances.
	fixed documentation of 'db_search cells'
	fixed sel_cell so it doesn't force read-in of selected cell.

2/16/00 Max 3.2.12 BETA
	added LAY_COARSE_FACTOR to contro coarse redisplay generation
	changed def of infinity to allow bigger coordinates.
	added -no_labels option to sel_net
	added MAX_VERSION_TAG (e.g. BETA)
	added compile time to abort message.

2/9/00 Max 3.2.11 (shipped as official release)
	fixed 'f' command
	(temporarily) backed out of 'bigger' INFINITY
	added -boolean to 'sel_what cells' 
	improved performance of 'sel_what types'
	
1/25/0 Max 3.2.9
	added wirepath mitering.

	added bounds checking (and clipping) of coordinates given
	on commands.

	added periodic feedback on number of elements read
	to GDS reading.

	rmed doubleint stuff in preparation for 64 bit port.

	latest and greatest maxtcl.

1/11/0 Max 3.2.8
        fixed new colormap handling

        added GDS_READ_NO_DRC switch

        added cs_hierInteractions (auto detects no hierarchical
        interactions for fast GDS WRITING)

        latest and greatest maxtcl


